# Slice C fixture: an explicit call `main(["--x"])` dispatches to the pattern-headed `main` clause.
# Expected: the clause runs once from the explicit call; entry-point selection does not run it again.
@doc "Pattern-headed `main` that prints `pattern-main` and returns 1 when called with `[\"--x\"]`."
main(["--x"]) = { print("pattern-main"); 1 }
print(main(["--x"]))
42
